  "title": "Devcontainer: multi-agent builder image with forced git hooks",
  "summary": "Rebuilds the devcontainer image around a pinned, checksum-verified toolchain (moon, gh, actionlint, uv, Node 22, pnpm, Bun) and installs four coding agents (codex, claude-code, opencode, omp) plus dsh, each wired to `osf hook` through root-owned, read-only hook files. The system-wide `core.hooksPath` is replaced by a git wrapper that forces `/opt/factory/githooks` on the command line for repositories under the workspace mount, and the image now proves its own invariants at build time with a suite of shell tests.",
